OL,3,GNEWSAFlooded rail line to shut for nine
OL,4,Adays for repair
OL,5,
OL,6,FA busy railway branch line will close
OL,7,Ffor nine days for repairs after it was
OL,8,Fdamaged during severe flooding in
OL,9,FDecember.
OL,11,FA burst Thames Water sewer pipe flooded
OL,12,Fthe tracks at Rye House station in
OL,13,FHertfordshire, with video showing water
OL,14,Fgushing over platforms.
OL,16,FRailway engineers will now replace 1km
OL,17,F(0.6 miles) of track, meaning there
OL,18,Fwill be no trains between Hertford East
OL,19,Fand Rye House from Saturday, 17 October
OL,20,Fto Sunday, 25 October.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
