OL,3,GNEWSAFlooded rail line to shut for nine
OL,4,Adays for repair
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin Beable, chief operating officer
OL,7,Ffor Great British Railways - Anglia,
OL,8,Fsaid: "We're really sorry for the
OL,9,Fdisruption, and advise that passengers
OL,10,Fstart planning ahead if possible."
